              "Categories": {
                "value": "Images from the Library of Congress|Images uploaded by Fæ|Artworks without Wikidata item|Rukhabad Mausoleum|PD-Art (PD-old-100)|Images from the World Digital Library|CC-PD-Mark|Samarkand in the Turkestan Album",
