                "value": "Images from the Library of Congress|Graphical projection|Images uploaded by Fæ|Artworks without Wikidata item|Ak Sarai Mausoleum, Samarkand|Rukhabad Mausoleum|PD-Art (PD-old-100)|Images from the World Digital Library|CC-PD-Mark|Architectural drawing sheets from Russia|Samarkand in the Turkestan Album",
